\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S1}{\ignorespaces Generation metrics across eight Pfam families (mean $\pm $ SE). SA gen: generation regime ($\beta \approx 2\beta ^*$). SA ret: retrieval regime ($\beta \approx 20\beta ^*$). BS: bootstrap. GP: Gaussian perturbation. CC: convex combination. KL: amino acid composition KL divergence ($\downarrow $ lower is better; SE via 1{,}000-fold bootstrap). Novelty: $1 - \max _k\cos (\hat  {\boldsymbol  {\xi }}, \mathbf  {m}_k)$ in PCA space ($\uparrow $ higher is better). SeqID: nearest sequence identity to a stored pattern after decoding ($\downarrow $ lower is better). Bold: best method per family and metric.}}{18}{table.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:results}{{S1}{18}{Generation metrics across eight Pfam families (mean $\pm $ SE). SA gen: generation regime ($\beta \approx 2\beta ^*$). SA ret: retrieval regime ($\beta \approx 20\beta ^*$). BS: bootstrap. GP: Gaussian perturbation. CC: convex combination. KL: amino acid composition KL divergence ($\downarrow $ lower is better; SE via 1{,}000-fold bootstrap). Novelty: $1 - \max _k\cos (\hat {\boldsymbol {\xi }}, \mathbf {m}_k)$ in PCA space ($\uparrow $ higher is better). SeqID: nearest sequence identity to a stored pattern after decoding ($\downarrow $ lower is better). Bold: best method per family and metric}{table.caption.2}{}}
